Sàataburu kà Korombɔɔru<br />Sɔ̃ɔ teèru Sàatabura Korombɔɔruǹ naàsu kà dàbusa piibunu yɛ̃.<br />Korombɔɔra wisa ta nɛɛ:<br />"Baa mɛ̀ a kà sãu ǹge woo, kon nun dùka kɔ̃ɔ̀."<br />Sàatabura mɛɛra mà Korombɔɔrun gari yi yi ǹ koòrɔ ma ta wura.<br />Ba nɔɔ̀sina mà Sɛ̀muuwa ga koò gbabùru bura kà ten nɔru.<br />Gàrasa tɔ̃ru sɔ̃nu Sàataburu kà Korombɔɔru ba dùka wɔri sànnu.<br />Korombɔɔra kùn yɔ̃re.<br />Korombɔɔra dɔɔ tɛɛru àdama ten dàbusanu dɛnde ma nu sɔ̃ɔ̀ sere kà gàrasan nɔrɔ.<br />Sàatabura kpuna swaà baarɔ ma ta dom wɔri.<br />Sàatabura raa dom yanda, ta dùkuru wĩa kà ten dam kpuro, àdama n dãkuru kua.<br />Korombɔɔra gàrasa di kɔ̀.<br />Dɛ̀ndaru kà tɛɛru sanum mu rà gàrasa di.<br /></body>
